  "steps": [
    "Slice the cucumber into thin half-moons and cut the feta into bite-sized cubes.",
    "In a bowl, combine the olives, olive oil, lemon juice, dried oregano, grated or finely minced garlic, black pepper, and salt.",
    "Add the cucumber and feta, then gently toss so the feta stays intact.",
    "Leave to marinate for 5 to 10 minutes, then scatter over the parsley and serve chilled or at room temperature."
